    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reporting a fault",
     "texto": [
      "**building caretaker** is the person in charge of the building's maintenance. **Lekkasje** means leak; **å dripppe**, to drip."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking for a repair",
     "texto": [
      "**Reparere** means to repair. To describe the problem you can say **Dusjen virker ikke** («The shower isn't working») or **Vannet er kaldt** («The water is cold»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
